    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>It's not just about the house or the chores, it's just everything. I look at them and I feel this overwhelming guilt because I'm so tired of it all, but at the same time, I just want everything to stop. I feel like I'm just waiting for an end that never comes. Sometimes I just lie here in the dark and wish I could just sleep and never have to wake up to this ever again. It feels like the only way to actually get some peace.",
