      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know. the \"peace\" i want doesnt feel like it's coming in a few hours. it feels like it's something much bigger. like, everything is so broken and exhausting that the idea of just... letting go... it sounds more logical than trying to keep fighting this every single day. it feels like my life is just a debt i can't pay back anymore. do you think it's wrong to feel like ending it all is the only real way to get that silence?",
